cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it."
type: software
title: "Auditing a brain-tumour MRI classifier: leakage, domain shift, and reliability"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible audit of a three-class brain-tumour MRI classifier (EfficientNet-B0):
  quantifying accuracy inflation from patient-level data leakage, auditing dataset
  independence, measuring robustness under controlled acquisition shift, diagnosing the
  failure, and testing label-free mitigations and uncertainty methods.
